      "kind": "method",
      "component": "core",
      "page": "api-reference.html",
      "signature": "[[nodiscard]] FArdaRHIStatus Compile(bool bForceRecompile = false)",
      "summary": "Apply the ordered queue and stage a persistent executable revision. Matching constructions reuse cached topology, compilation and runtime. Success clears the queue and locks edits until Execute/Submit is attempted. Failure preserves the queue for repair or DiscardPendingEdits. With no queued construction, re-stage the current persistent graph. Force bypasses cache lookup. Switching revisions retires the outgoing runtime's submissions; reusing that same runtime preserves frame-slot overlap. Requires closed edits and no outstanding staged execution lock.",
      "details": "Apply the ordered queue and stage a persistent executable revision. Matching constructions reuse cached topology, compilation and runtime. Success clears the queue and locks edits until Execute/Submit is attempted. Failure preserves the queue for repair or DiscardPendingEdits. With no queued construction, re-stage the current persistent graph. Force bypasses cache lookup. Switching revisions retires the outgoing runtime's submissions; reusing that same runtime preserves frame-slot overlap. Requires closed edits and no outstanding staged execution lock.",
